[ceiling] These are the flat finger-bearing roofs of the two rounded cartridge grips. Each roof spans the 18 by 15 mm pocket and joins the surrounding cartridge body. The production slice supplies one bed-rooted support beneath each roof. Both supports leave through the open side pockets before the pumps are installed.
